<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>医疗保险 on 编程那些事儿</title><link>https://before80.github.io/prgms/tags/%E5%8C%BB%E7%96%97%E4%BF%9D%E9%99%A9/</link><description>Recent content in 医疗保险 on 编程那些事儿</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-cn</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 10:31:03 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://before80.github.io/prgms/tags/%E5%8C%BB%E7%96%97%E4%BF%9D%E9%99%A9/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>医疗保险与账单：出示保险卡、账单有疑问、网络外怎么办</title><link>https://before80.github.io/prgms/Language/English/Learn/dialogue/health/insurance/</link><pubDate>Mon, 21 Sep 2026 23:43:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://before80.github.io/prgms/Language/English/Learn/dialogue/health/insurance/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;美国医疗最让人措手不及的不是看病，是&lt;strong&gt;账单&lt;/strong&gt;。看诊当天你可能只付了 $25，三周后收到一封信，上面写着 &lt;code&gt;You owe $847.00&lt;/code&gt;。这不是搞错了——这就是美国医保的运作方式。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>预约与改期</title><link>https://before80.github.io/prgms/Language/English/Learn/dialogue/life/appointments/</link><pubDate>Mon, 21 Sep 2026 23:40:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://before80.github.io/prgms/Language/English/Learn/dialogue/life/appointments/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;这一篇按&lt;strong&gt;从约到改到取消&lt;/strong&gt;的顺序，拆成五个细化场景：打电话约新病人体检顺便问保险、约剪头发又临时改时间、约修车先说好估价和取车时间、约牙医洗牙确认共付额、餐厅订位临时取消被问要不要改期。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>